"About IP purity" = "About IP purity";
"IP purity explanation" = "IPPure data comes from internet risk intelligence databases and honeypot statistics. IP records with monitoring history are the foundation of risk control. IPPure already has a large volume of records, and popular IP ranges have higher record density. The risk value for an IP decays over time as risk-control records age. It is impossible to obtain complete monitoring data for every IPv4 address on the internet, so when no risk-control information is found for an IP, IPPure infers from its IP range and related signals. For IPv6 addresses, because the address space is huge and data sources are limited, the IPPure coefficient is not calculated.";
